-     entry .publish   `cell.publish(value)`: a release store (`lazySet`) to an `Atomic.Ref`
-     entry .swap   `cell.swap(value)`: stores a value in an `Atomic.Ref` and returns the one displaced
-     entry .replace   `cell.replace(expected, updated)`: compare-and-set by reference equality, true if it took
