+       Gossamer の `Decimalizer(significantFigures, decimalPlaces, …)` が設定可能な実装であり、数値の `Showable` インスタンスはそれを召喚する。
+   entry #decimalize   テキストとしての `Double`

- entry .&   `case A(x) & B(y)`: matches one value against two extractors at once
-     An extractor object, exported from `rudiments.internal`, whose `unapply` yields the
-     scrutinee twice: `value match case AsInt(x) & AsLong(y) => …` binds `x` from the first
-     extractor and `y` from the second on the same value, which otherwise needs a nested
-     match or a guard.
